<title>CHINA: Natural gas fields found in China's Hangzhou Bay.</title>
<headline>Natural gas fields found in China's Hangzhou Bay.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six natural gas field have been found in Hangzhou Bay off China's eastern province of Zhejiang, the Xinhua news agency said on Monday.</p>
<p>The gas field, Zhejiang's first such find, covers an area of more than 150 sq km, the agency said.</p>
<p>It has 343 million cubic metres of gas, 10 times the annual gas supply of the provincial capital of Hangzhou, Xinhua said. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (86-10) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
